@k.words.mars.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Mars pos=noun n=1 gloss="a small reddish planet that is the 4th from the sun and is periodically visible to the naked eye; minerals rich in iron cover its surface and are responsible for its characteristic color" synonym="Red Planet" instance_of="terrestrial planet" instance_of="superior planet" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
